Z||000000||loafer87gt||05-06-2000||06:12 PM||||Here are some pics of my stereo before it got stolen. I just took these pictures a couple of days ago. Coincidence or what? At least they should be usefull to the insurance guys. The sub box is about 3.5 inches deep and houses a Soundstream Rubicon subwoofer. (really tight sounding) I have the wiring going through the firewall to a MTX 275 Amplifier. The birth certificate for the amp shows that it is actually the third one of this model built, and is puttin gout almost twice the rated output! My old headunit was a Clarion 6555 and was a super unit, never skipped and sounded nice and clear. The dash speakers and rear pillar speakers are the factory GM units. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image03.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image03.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image08.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image08.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image12.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image12.jpg</A> <P><BR>||||reg||1
